{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X纵向交替的排法不如Y左右并置方便一眼对照故事和感受，而且S06、S13的感受提示仍然较密，连续出现时可能让观众忙于追字。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势不只是感受描写更丰富，而是把叙事重点、音乐变化和人物心理转折组织成了有先后关系的阅读过程：重点词放大帮助迅速抓住故事，感受分时出现则让观众能把具体声音和心理变化对应起来。尤其从怀念亲近、旧伤重新浮现、孤独动摇，到最后不再逼自己选边，X既交代了人物为什么这样，也通过旧歌、舞曲、摇篮曲等音乐线索形成前后呼应。Y的左右并置确实直观，但不少感受词更像同时摆出的情绪标签，观众容易知道这里有悲伤、焦躁或温柔，却不一定能体会这些感受是怎样随着音乐逐步发生和转变的。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f2959ed3-b589-4a51-8c10-fbfb6dbaa9f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154650908539Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.921, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:48:22.833042+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "89ffd37f245903ac03aa72bd4d3f4b391c5b6bdea729b3e164b15d5729c926fe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0